## 🔐 Security Requirements

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| Auth | JWT (ký ở svc-auth, verify ở Gateway) |
| Password | bcrypt với cost factor ≥ 12 |
| Rate Limit | 100 req/min cho auth, 1000 req/min cho API (gateway-level) |
| CORS | whitelist domains trong env (gateway-level) |
| HTTPS | enforce trong production (gateway-level) |
| SQL Injection | Prisma parameterized queries |
| XSS | sanitize input, set CSP headers (gateway-level) |
| CSRF | SameSite cookies + CSRF tokens |
| Inter-service | Consul + circuit breaker + tracing |

